  "video_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c",
  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "你相信吗，一个人的财富来得越晚越好，少年得志易翻船，大器晚成真大才，人不必在同一个年纪成熟，每个人都有自己的秋天，我们将在8月7日迎来秋天的第一个节气，立秋。乾坤未定，别急着论成败，哪一天真正成熟，哪一天就是你的秋天。#立秋节气 #二十四节气 #秋天 #治愈感",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 185.712993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "周军，你相信吗？一个人的财富来得越晚越好。少年得志，一、帆船，大器晚成，真大财。人不必在同一个年纪成熟，每个人都有自己的秋天，我们将在八月七号迎来秋天的第一个节气。立秋都说指缝太宽，时光太瘦，未觉三夏，尽时去以新秋。但是立秋可不是立刻变凉，中国各个地方真正进入气象意义上的秋天，时间并不相同，古人甚至在夏天会使用麦秋这个词儿。因为麦子在初夏成熟，死于实，虽夏于麦则秋，所以秋这个字啊一直不只是代表某个日期，也代表每一种生命自己成熟的时刻。你看有人二十多岁结婚，有人四十岁才遇到爱情，有人年少成名，有人大器晚成，有人正在收获，有人才刚刚发芽，请允许自己慢慢换季。同一天，立秋不代表每个人都要同时入秋。朱军，我今年三十三岁，如果能回到十年前，二十三岁，我一定会对那个更年轻的自己说一句话，你不必在二十岁就找到一生的答案。真正能够稳住大财富的人，往往都是在中年。以后这个时候要心态，有心态，要经验，有经验，懂得进退，也懂得。守藏乾坤，未定，别着急，论成败，哪一天真正成熟，哪一天就是你的秋天。你看，立秋虽在同一天，而秋天却不是同时抵达。此时节。北方的清晨有露水，仿佛一夜入秋，而江南依旧蝉鸣和盛晚稻清青，岭南更是暑期未退，交夜还呈着午后的咒语，有人在添衣，有人仍在摇膳。我们共享同一个节气，却在不同的风里。第一次收到秋天的来信，究竟允许自己做个晚熟的人，不必焦虑，别人比你提前拥有。你有没有发现本性善良的人都比较晚熟，而且他们是被猎人催熟的当其他人聪明伶俐时，他们既傻又呆。当其他人在权衡利弊时，他们却一片赤诚。当其他人用尽一切心机手段时，他们才灵魂开窍。即便开窍之后，内心依然保持着善良与赤诚。他们试图寻找同类，到头来却发现自己是最孤独的。那个。你总说时间很慢，但走着走着，秋天就到了。人生总有太多的来不及。时间走的太快。一叶落天下秋，立秋这天记得恳丘咬丘啃一口秋瓜解一下暑气。而我看，秋标就没必要贴了。我多想把多余的脂肪捐给那些真正需要的人。如今花有花期，人有食运，要努力，但别着急，不要看见别人开花结果，就觉得自己枯萎。你没有落后，也没有领先。在命运为你安排的属于你的时，区里一切都是准时的鼠去又弈秋，愿君多珍重。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 350,
      "end_ms": 750,
      "text": "周军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1090,
      "end_ms": 1870,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2130,
      "end_ms": 4450,
      "text": "一个人的财富来得越晚越好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4950,
      "end_ms": 5950,
      "text": "少年得志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5970,
      "end_ms": 6610,
      "text": "一、帆船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 6950,
      "end_ms": 7930,
      "text": "大器晚成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8050,
      "end_ms": 8710,
      "text": "真大财。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 9250,
      "end_ms": 11150,
      "text": "人不必在同一个年纪成熟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 11450,
      "end_ms": 12950,
      "text": "每个人都有自己的秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 13650,
      "end_ms": 16530,
      "text": "我们将在八月七号迎来秋天的第一个节气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16810,
      "end_ms": 19590,
      "text": "立秋都说指缝太宽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19890,
      "end_ms": 20910,
      "text": "时光太瘦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21530,
      "end_ms": 22590,
      "text": "未觉三夏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 22590,
      "end_ms": 24490,
      "text": "尽时去以新秋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24750,
      "end_ms": 26770,
      "text": "但是立秋可不是立刻变凉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 27050,
      "end_ms": 29915,
      "text": "中国各个地方真正进入气象意义上的秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 30200,
      "end_ms": 31340,
      "text": "时间并不相同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 31760,
      "end_ms": 34760,
      "text": "古人甚至在夏天会使用麦秋这个词儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 34920,
      "end_ms": 36560,
      "text": "因为麦子在初夏成熟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 37020,
      "end_ms": 37740,
      "text": "死于实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 37780,
      "end_ms": 39360,
      "text": "虽夏于麦则秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 39840,
      "end_ms": 42840,
      "text": "所以秋这个字啊一直不只是代表某个日期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43020,
      "end_ms": 45940,
      "text": "也代表每一种生命自己成熟的时刻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 46220,
      "end_ms": 48400,
      "text": "你看有人二十多岁结婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 48600,
      "end_ms": 50560,
      "text": "有人四十岁才遇到爱情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 50940,
      "end_ms": 52220,
      "text": "有人年少成名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 52340,
      "end_ms": 53720,
      "text": "有人大器晚成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 54080,
      "end_ms": 55220,
      "text": "有人正在收获，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 55480,
      "end_ms": 56900,
      "text": "有人才刚刚发芽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 57260,
      "end_ms": 59625,
      "text": "请允许自己慢慢换季。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 60020,
      "end_ms": 60440,
      "text": "同一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 60440,
      "end_ms": 63180,
      "text": "立秋不代表每个人都要同时入秋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 63440,
      "end_ms": 63984,
      "text": "朱军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 64300,
      "end_ms": 65555,
      "text": "我今年三十三岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 65950,
      "end_ms": 67450,
      "text": "如果能回到十年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 67510,
      "end_ms": 68295,
      "text": "二十三岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 68700,
      "end_ms": 71225,
      "text": "我一定会对那个更年轻的自己说一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 71800,
      "end_ms": 74495,
      "text": "你不必在二十岁就找到一生的答案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 74970,
      "end_ms": 76790,
      "text": "真正能够稳住大财富的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 76790,
      "end_ms": 78090,
      "text": "往往都是在中年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 78090,
      "end_ms": 80260,
      "text": "以后这个时候要心态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00042",
      "start_ms": 80260,
      "end_ms": 80840,
      "text": "有心态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00043",
      "start_ms": 81000,
      "end_ms": 81540,
      "text": "要经验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00044",
      "start_ms": 81540,
      "end_ms": 82135,
      "text": "有经验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00045",
      "start_ms": 82440,
      "end_ms": 83200,
      "text": "懂得进退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00046",
      "start_ms": 83260,
      "end_ms": 83740,
      "text": "也懂得。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00047",
      "start_ms": 83740,
      "end_ms": 85210,
      "text": "守藏乾坤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00048",
      "start_ms": 85290,
      "end_ms": 85670,
      "text": "未定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00049",
      "start_ms": 85790,
      "end_ms": 86490,
      "text": "别着急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00050",
      "start_ms": 86490,
      "end_ms": 87215,
      "text": "论成败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00051",
      "start_ms": 87570,
      "end_ms": 88850,
      "text": "哪一天真正成熟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00052",
      "start_ms": 89110,
      "end_ms": 90665,
      "text": "哪一天就是你的秋天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00053",
      "start_ms": 91050,
      "end_ms": 91430,
      "text": "你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00054",
      "start_ms": 91710,
      "end_ms": 93030,
      "text": "立秋虽在同一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00055",
      "start_ms": 93090,
      "end_ms": 95025,
      "text": "而秋天却不是同时抵达。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00056",
      "start_ms": 95430,
      "end_ms": 95970,
      "text": "此时节。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00057",
      "start_ms": 95990,
      "end_ms": 97510,
      "text": "北方的清晨有露水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00058",
      "start_ms": 97710,
      "end_ms": 99050,
      "text": "仿佛一夜入秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00059",
      "start_ms": 99330,
      "end_ms": 102595,
      "text": "而江南依旧蝉鸣和盛晚稻清青，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00060",
      "start_ms": 103000,
      "end_ms": 104560,
      "text": "岭南更是暑期未退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00061",
      "start_ms": 104720,
      "end_ms": 106705,
      "text": "交夜还呈着午后的咒语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00062",
      "start_ms": 107080,
      "end_ms": 108020,
      "text": "有人在添衣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00063",
      "start_ms": 108160,
      "end_ms": 109360,
      "text": "有人仍在摇膳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00064",
      "start_ms": 109700,
      "end_ms": 111285,
      "text": "我们共享同一个节气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00065",
      "start_ms": 111530,
      "end_ms": 112695,
      "text": "却在不同的风里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00066",
      "start_ms": 112890,
      "end_ms": 114805,
      "text": "第一次收到秋天的来信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00067",
      "start_ms": 115170,
      "end_ms": 117765,
      "text": "究竟允许自己做个晚熟的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00068",
      "start_ms": 118080,
      "end_ms": 118720,
      "text": "不必焦虑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00069",
      "start_ms": 118720,
      "end_ms": 120245,
      "text": "别人比你提前拥有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00070",
      "start_ms": 120510,
      "end_ms": 123540,
      "text": "你有没有发现本性善良的人都比较晚熟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00071",
      "start_ms": 123800,
      "end_ms": 127675,
      "text": "而且他们是被猎人催熟的当其他人聪明伶俐时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00072",
      "start_ms": 127930,
      "end_ms": 129125,
      "text": "他们既傻又呆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00073",
      "start_ms": 129440,
      "end_ms": 131340,
      "text": "当其他人在权衡利弊时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00074",
      "start_ms": 131460,
      "end_ms": 132640,
      "text": "他们却一片赤诚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00075",
      "start_ms": 132920,
      "end_ms": 135300,
      "text": "当其他人用尽一切心机手段时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00076",
      "start_ms": 135380,
      "end_ms": 136795,
      "text": "他们才灵魂开窍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00077",
      "start_ms": 137170,
      "end_ms": 138150,
      "text": "即便开窍之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00078",
      "start_ms": 138290,
      "end_ms": 140355,
      "text": "内心依然保持着善良与赤诚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00079",
      "start_ms": 140800,
      "end_ms": 142120,
      "text": "他们试图寻找同类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00080",
      "start_ms": 142340,
      "end_ms": 144740,
      "text": "到头来却发现自己是最孤独的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00081",
      "start_ms": 144740,
      "end_ms": 145135,
      "text": "那个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00082",
      "start_ms": 145590,
      "end_ms": 146975,
      "text": "你总说时间很慢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00083",
      "start_ms": 147240,
      "end_ms": 147980,
      "text": "但走着走着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00084",
      "start_ms": 147980,
      "end_ms": 148865,
      "text": "秋天就到了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00085",
      "start_ms": 149270,
      "end_ms": 151185,
      "text": "人生总有太多的来不及。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00086",
      "start_ms": 151640,
      "end_ms": 152915,
      "text": "时间走的太快。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00087",
      "start_ms": 153280,
      "end_ms": 155115,
      "text": "一叶落天下秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00088",
      "start_ms": 155540,
      "end_ms": 160625,
      "text": "立秋这天记得恳丘咬丘啃一口秋瓜解一下暑气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00089",
      "start_ms": 160920,
      "end_ms": 161320,
      "text": "而我看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00090",
      "start_ms": 161320,
      "end_ms": 162755,
      "text": "秋标就没必要贴了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00091",
      "start_ms": 163010,
      "end_ms": 165955,
      "text": "我多想把多余的脂肪捐给那些真正需要的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00092",
      "start_ms": 166340,
      "end_ms": 168275,
      "text": "如今花有花期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00093",
      "start_ms": 168630,
      "end_ms": 169865,
      "text": "人有食运，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00094",
      "start_ms": 170220,
      "end_ms": 170915,
      "text": "要努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00095",
      "start_ms": 171210,
      "end_ms": 171985,
      "text": "但别着急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00096",
      "start_ms": 172370,
      "end_ms": 173890,
      "text": "不要看见别人开花结果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00097",
      "start_ms": 173890,
      "end_ms": 175075,
      "text": "就觉得自己枯萎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00098",
      "start_ms": 175450,
      "end_ms": 176210,
      "text": "你没有落后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00099",
      "start_ms": 176410,
      "end_ms": 177365,
      "text": "也没有领先。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00100",
      "start_ms": 177730,
      "end_ms": 179770,
      "text": "在命运为你安排的属于你的时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00101",
      "start_ms": 179770,
      "end_ms": 183480,
      "text": "区里一切都是准时的鼠去又弈秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c11af1fb830ad64c_s00102",
      "start_ms": 183840,
      "end_ms": 185305,
      "text": "愿君多珍重。"
    }
  ],
